### IRSA (IAM Roles for Service Accounts)

The service account is annotated with an IAM role ARN that grants:

- **OpenSearch** - Read/write access to vector index
- **Bedrock** - Invoke model permissions for Claude and Titan

**IAM Policy example:**

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "es:ESHttpPost",
        "es:ESHttpPut",
        "es:ESHttpGet"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:es:us-east-1:*:domain/*"
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "bedrock:InvokeModel"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1::foundation-model/anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6",
        "arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1::foundation-model/amazon.titan-embed-text-v2:0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
